"new_string": "//^>Some users report runs freezing or stopping partway, so they have to restart or re-upload.</div></div></div></div><div id=\"rev-sample\"><div style={subhead}>Summary</div><div style={{fontSize:16,lineHeight:1.55,color:theme.text.primary}}>{archiveReady?`${matched.toLocaleString(\"en-US\")} will be deleted. ${kept.toLocaleString(\"en-US\")} stay.`:\"Counts appear once your archive loads.\"}</div>{archiveReady&&matched>0&&(<div style={{fontSize:14,color:theme.text.secondary,lineHeight:1.5,marginTop:6}}>{totalsRows.filter((row)=>row[0]!==\"Total\"&&row[1]!==\"0\"&&row[1]!==\"n/a\").map((row)=>`${row[1]} ${row[0].toLowerCase()}`).join(\" · \")}</div>)}<div style={{marginTop:12}}><Button label=\"Keep or change anything in Pick\" variant=\"quiet\" onClick={()=>{setListView(\"delete\");goStep(\"pick\");}}/></div></div><div id=\"rev-export\" style={{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",gap:14}}><div><div style={subhead}>Export and cooling-off</div><div style={{...subhint,margin:0}}>Deletes are permanent. Download the list first; it has every link, date and the rule that matched.</div></div><div style={{display:\"flex\",flexWrap:\"wrap\",gap:12,alignItems:\"flex-end\"}}><Select label=\"Format\" value={exportFmt} onChange={(v:string)=>setExportFmt(v)} options={[{value:\"csv\",label:\"CSV\"},{value:\"json\",label:\"JSON\"}]}/><Button label=\"Download the delete list\" onClick={doExport} disabled={matched===0}/></div>{exportNote!==\"\"&&<div style={{fontSize:13,color:theme.text.success}}>{exportNote}</div>}<Toggle label=\"Cooling-off: nothing is deleted for 24 hours after you approve, so you can change your mind. Off by default.\" value={coolOn} onChange={setCoolOn}/>{coolOn&&<div style={_s12}>{`First batch starts ${finishDate(1)}. You can cancel or change rules until then.`}</div>}</div><div id=\"rev-more\"><Section heading=\"More options\" collapsible defaultOpen={false}><Toggle label=\"Remove my likes (unlike posts I liked)\" value={likesOn} onChange={setLikesOn}/><div style={{fontSize:13,color:theme.text.secondary,lineHeight:1.45,marginTop:-6}}>Separate from deleting your posts. Off unless you turn it on. Runs in the Free browser lane at a slower, safe pace.</div>{likesOn&&(<><Text>{likesTotal>0?`Unliking uses the same daily limit as deleting: your posts first, then likes. ${likesTotal.toLocaleString()} likes from like.js, done by ${finishDate(likesDays)}. Some likes on deleted or protected posts can't be reached; we list any that stick.`:\"Unliking uses the same daily limit as deleting: your posts first, then likes. Your like count appears once your archive loads.\"}</Text></>)}</Section></div><div id=\"rev-approve\" style={{paddingTop:4}}>{tapLine(\"Approve this cleanup with the tap card in the chat.\")}</div></div>)}"
